# Constitutional Files List
#
# Files on this list require a linked authority record in the commit message
# or a CONSTITUTIONAL-OVERRIDE: tag when modified.
#
# This file is itself constitutionally protected — modifications to the list
# require the same authority as modifications to any file on it.
#
# Established: 2026-07-21 (Decision 62, Grilling Session 8)
# Plan: docs/design/authority-sensitivity-component-plan.md
#
# Format: one relative path per line, from repository root.
# Lines starting with # are comments.

